<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <title>AI in Action - Reset Password</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f8fafc; padding: 24px; color: #1e293b;">
  <div style="max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; padding: 32px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">
    <h2 style="color: #2563eb; margin-top: 0;">Reset your password</h2>
    <p>Hi <strong><%= name %></strong>,</p>
    <p>We received a request to reset your AI in Action account password. This link is valid for <strong>1 hour</strong>.</p>
    <p style="margin: 28px 0;">
      <a href="<%= resetUrl %>" style="display: inline-block; background: #2563eb; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 20px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: bold;">
        Reset Password
      </a>
    </p>
    <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 13px;">If you did not request this, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
